IN THE COURT OF {courtDesignation}
AT {courtPlace}
(CRIMINAL REVISIONAL JURISDICTION)

{caseNomenclature}

IN THE MATTER OF:
{petitioner} ... Petitioner / Revisionist
VERSUS
{respondent} ... Respondent

prayerTemplate:
PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, the Petitioner / Revisionist most respectfully prays that this Hon'ble Court, in exercise of its revisional jurisdiction under Section {applicable_section} of the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023, may graciously be pleased to:

a) Call for the records of the case from the Court of {impugned_order_court}, examine the correctness, legality and propriety of the impugned order dated {impugned_order_date};

b) Set aside / quash / modify the impugned order dated {impugned_order_date} passed by the Court of {impugned_order_court} in {case_details};

c) Pending hearing and final disposal of this revision, stay the operation of the impugned order and further proceedings before the Court below;

d) Award costs of this revision;

e) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper in the interest of justice.

And for this act of kindness, the Petitioner / Revisionist shall ever pray.
